<title>CHINA: HUNG HING YEARLY PROFIT RISES 52 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>HUNG HING YEARLY PROFIT RISES 52 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   34.9	 vs 23.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    11.0	 vs 8.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  12.07 gain vs 1.57 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    162.48     vs 107.06</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,064.11   vs 990.41</p>
<p>    Company name		 Hung Hing Printing Group Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 15-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 8</p>
<p>NOTE - Hung Hing manufactures packaging.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$12.41 million on write-back of provision for diminution in value of listed investments and loss of HK$0.34 million on disposal of listed investments.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 15 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of four cents) vs 12 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
